      {
        "id": 221154,
        "name": "KateWalker",
        "username": "TakeWalker",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/takewalker/{size}/5677_2.png",
        "created_at": "2018-08-10T13:02:54.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>You get a favor every time a hero target deals a non-hero target 4 or more damage, so 7 is the correct answer in that case.</p><p>Also, both of those fours count, since she essentially hits the villain targets twice. I'm assuming there were only three, or some combination of destruction and/or Dymkharn.</p><p>Also, she can pick up the Indiscriminate easily, if that's an option. :B Just for the sake of completeness.</p>",
